I'm not exactly sure what went wrong with the wiki.  Whatever did
happen, it's working again.  I had to reinstall it.  That seemed to
work, so I'm not going to start asking questions - when something good
happens, you shut up and run with it.

I think it was a problem with how I migrated from the old domain
(fsdev.dreamhosters.com) to the new one (fsdev.net).  This is how I
made the change the first time:

$ mv /home/fsdev/fsdev.dreamhosters.com/wiki /home/fsdev/fsdev.net/wiki

I'm not sure why it worked for a while and then stopped.  Whatever the
problem the problem is gone now.

